{"id":"75bb18f474452a05","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-incompleteness-theorems.md","title":"Incompleteness Theorems","display":"df-incompleteness-theorems — Incompleteness Theorems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-incompleteness-theorems","aliases":["88-df-incompleteness-theorems"],"display":"df-incompleteness-theorems — Incompleteness Theorems","depends_on":["[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-incompleteness-theorems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-incompleteness-theorems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompleteness-theorems — Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\\)</span> (syntactic-incompleteness predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (omega-consistency predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S\">\\(\\nu_S\\)</span>；第一式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\\)</span> 仍适用于任意一阶签名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}theorems} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash_R\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash_R\\neg\\sigma\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}theorems} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Incomplete}_R(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash_R\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash_R\\neg\\sigma\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}theorems}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl[\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;T\\vdash_R\\varphi[\\nu_S(n)/x])\n\\to T\\nvdash_R\\exists x\\;\\neg\\varphi\n\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}theorems}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\omega\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl[\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;T\\vdash_R\\varphi[\\nu_S(n)/x])\n\\to T\\nvdash_R\\exists x\\;\\neg\\varphi\n\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一式定义句法不完全性；第二式补足后续 Gödel 句独立性所使用的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性，不再把它留作未定义的侧条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a72f024d8d